# Feature scope

Build: opaque `re_dbg_backend` vtable, debug session, TUI CPU-like panes, CLI and MCP
command table, dual-OS stub backends that link.

Skip: Qt GUI, pure static PE triage / FLIRT / capa / analyze-all (that is antistrefo),
kernel debugging, macOS.

Debugger is in scope. Do not add a Skip Debugger rule.
Session arena is long-lived; per-command arenas are short-lived.
